#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:323
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Our workspace definition became pure Swift code. Touching the project structure used to mean editing .pbxproj files whose diffs no human can read; now each domain team declares and owns its module configuration in Swift, and structure changes are reviewable diffs. Dependencies became visible data too — with the module graph declared in code, we finally have concrete, shared data to ground our dependency discussions."
msgstr "我们的工作区定义变成了纯 Swift 代码。过去，调整项目结构意味着编辑无人能读懂的 .pbxproj 文件差异；现在，每个领域团队都用 Swift 声明并管理其模块配置，结构变更也变成了可审查的差异。依赖关系也成为了可见的数据——通过在代码中声明模块图，我们终于有了具体、共享的数据来支撑依赖讨论。"

